 ('b6310000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','DRILL-BC-2026-003','fire','Simulated bagasse conveyor fire with smoke affecting the east evacuation route.','2026-07-15','10:00','Belle Rive Sugar & Energy Complex',45,39,186,184,'Production, Energy, Engineering, HSE, Laboratory',6.8,true,'Test alarm, alternate route, wardens, accountability and control-room escalation.','Two visitors initially approached the normal route before redirection.','Alarm audible; wardens decisive; digital accountability fast.','Visitor host briefing did not mention alternate route.','Add alternate-route card to visitor induction and drill contractor gate team.','good','Vikash Nundlall','Aisha Raman','completed')
